    "synthesis_rationale": "Starting from a 0.44 anchor, the strongest updates push toward 0.60 by combining a credible coalition route with rising TISZA poll shares and plausible opposition unity. Downward forces include fragmentation risk and uncertainty from markets. The final probability reflects net positive drift with a reasonably wide calibrated range; however, model uncertainty remains high due to volatile polling and uncertain turnout."
